dde-desktop-videowallpaper-plugin (2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * fix: resizeEvent override removed from VideoProxy (fought layout)
  * fix: predicateAction lookup uses key() instead of values().contains()
  * fix: turnOn() was unsubscribing instead of subscribing WindowAboutToBeBuilded
  * fix: ffprobe stdout read before deleteLater() (read-after-free)
  * fix: play() early-returns if videos still empty after refreshSource()
  * fix: checkResource() debounced to suppress notification spam
  * fix: CMakeLists now calls find_package(PkgConfig) before pkg_check_modules
  * fix: %0 -> %1 in notification string
  * fix: volume migration now persisted to DConfig on first run
  * fix: checkResource lambda guarded against stale this after turnOff()
  * fix: disableAction no longer wipes pauseOnFullscreen/pauseIdleSeconds
  * feat: volume control (0-100) replacing binary enableAudio toggle
  * feat: playback speed control (0.25x-2x) persisted in DConfig
  * feat: per-screen video assignment for multi-monitor setups
  * feat: applyMpvSettings() applies volume+speed on every play/refresh
  * feat: idle/scale/speed/volume menus use QActionGroup (exclusive)

 -- K4RLT <karl@karl-pc>  Sat, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800

dde-desktop-videowallpaper-plugin (1.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * fix: HiDPI render correction using physical pixels for mpv FBO
  * fix: config cache not updating after external DConfig change
  * fix: enable/disable handler guard was always blocking turnOn/turnOff
  * fix: ffprobe no longer blocks the UI thread when selecting a video
  * fix: play() and refreshSource() no longer race to double-load video
  * fix: turnOn() leaked watcher and timer on double-call
  * fix: getVideos() now filters by video extension only
  * fix: use qobject_cast instead of dynamic_cast in event filter

 -- K4RLT <karl@karl-pc>  Mon, 09 Mar 2026 08:57:41 +0000

dde-desktop-videowallpaper-plugin (1.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * be compatible with deepin 25
  * remove Qt5 support, focusing solely on Qt6
  * fix org.deepin.dde-shell root widget has titlebar
  * use libmpv instead of QtMultimedia
  * fix dde-shell random crash issue
  * be compatible with dde-file-manager 6.5.7

